<http://purl.org/dc/terms/date> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Date may be used to express temporal information at any level of granularity.  Recommended best practice is to use an encoding scheme, such as the W3CDTF profile of ISO 8601 [W3CDTF]."@en;
